Arara Code: open the extension-owned terminal options directly from the panel +.

Why a patch: extension APIs cannot replace the panel title launcher introduced
by 0018. This hook uses the standard workbench context menu; labels and terminal
execution remain in arara-ai through the existing commands. No process or
filesystem logic is added to the core.
Touches: panelPart.ts and panelpart.css.

